  "question": {
    "text": "A particle is moving in a straight line. The variation of position <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> as a function of time <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math> is given as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>. The velocity of the body when its acceleration becomes zero is:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "DTjlG",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EVVrC",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "jBAdH",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
