  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given the instantaneous position is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>The velocity of the particle is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mi>v</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>And, the acceleration of the particle is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>6</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>When <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, it implies</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></p><p>At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>, the velocity can be calculated as follows:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mi>v</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>8</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
